P(X = k) = \binom{10}{k} \left(\frac{1}{2}\right)^{10}
\] So the probability of getting at least 8 heads is: \[
P(X \geq 8) = P(X = 8) + P(X = 9) + P(X = 10)
\] \[
P(X = 8) = \binom{10}{8} \left(\frac{1}{2}\right)^{10} = \frac{10!}{8!2!} \left(\frac{1}{2}\right)^{10} = \frac{45}{1024}
\] \[
